```

The timeout defaults to five seconds.

@expected README.md
# Orders service

## Configuration

The payment gateway is configured through the environment. Set this in
your `.env` before starting the service:

```sh
PAYMENT_GATEWAY_URL=https://gateway.payments.example/v2
```

The timeout defaults to five seconds.
